==Trivia==
* Logos for {{g|UNITE}}, as well as the map of [[Remoat Stadium]], are seen on the screens behind Phorus and Erbie. As later chapters will indicate, many of the assets of the Pokémon UNITE game are used in the fictional world.
*Keep an eye on the backgrounds. Incidental characters often wear items taken directly from Pokémon UNITE. In this case, the [[Trainer fashion item|Purple Unite Set]], [[Trainer fashion item|Eldegoss Set]], and the [[Trainer fashion item|Snorlax Set]], are present. One other set could not be identified by name, but its a visual match for various [[Holowear]] of the Dark Suit Style, and was included in the [[Battle Pass (UNITE)|Agent of Disaster Battle Pass]].
**Other items include the [[Trainer fashion item|Straw Hat (Off-White)]] and the [[Trainer fashion item|Orange Unite Set: Headwear]].

